    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "DNG Farrelly Southern are delighted to present No. 17 Straffan Green, an attractive three-bedroom end-of-terrace home situated within the popular Straffan Wood development in Maynooth.\n\nThis well-proportioned property offers a practical and comfortable layout, making it an excellent choice for first-time buyers, young families or those looking to downsize. The accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall with guest WC and useful storage closet, a spacious kitchen/dining room, separate utility room and a comfortable living room. Upstairs there are three bedrooms, including a generous main bedroom with ensuite, together with the main family bathroom.\n\nA particularly appealing feature of No. 17 is its position within the development. The property is not directly overlooked to either the front or rear, providing an enhanced sense of privacy. Being an end-of-terrace home also adds to its appeal.\n\nParking is available to the front, while the overall setting offers an attractive residential environment within easy reach of Maynooth and its wide range of amenities. No. 17 Straffan Green represents a wonderful opportunity to acquire a three-bedroom home in a highly sought-after Maynooth location and is sure to appeal to a broad range of purchasers.\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
