        "Content": "Three-bedroom end-of-terrace home\nGas fired central heating\nMaster bedroom with ensuite and guest wc\nSeparate utility room and Storage closet\nNot directly overlooked to the front or rear\nExcellent level of privacy\nParking to the front\nIdeal for first-time buyers\nExcellent option for those looking to downsize\nConvenient location situated in the popular Straffan Wood development\n\n\n"
